  "citation": "Haszpra L (1998): Atmospheric CO2 Record from In Situ Measurements at K-Puszta, Hungary (1981 - 1997). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.014",
